\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use the AI Creator Tools page for captions, hooks, bios, posts and other Gemini-powered drafts.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do social tools guarantee growth?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. They help with workflow and ideas, but reach and engagement depend on many outside factors.\"}}]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://a2zconvertor.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Social Media Tools\",\"item\":\"https://a2zconvertor.co.uk/social-media-tools\"}]}]</script><section class=\"px-6 pb-16 pt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">0<!-- --> browser-based tools</p><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Free Social Media Tools</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">Explore social media tools for creators, small businesses, students and marketers, with AI creator tools available on the dedicated AI page.</p></div></section><section class=\"px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-slate-900/40 px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Useful creator tools</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-slate-400\">Prepare the images, videos and text that support your social media workflow.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/convert/meme-generator\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Meme Generator</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Create a classic meme image with top and bottom text online for free.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/convert/video-thumbnail-extractor\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Video Tools</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Video Thumbnail Extractor</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Extract a selected video frame from MP4, WEBM or MOV and download it as PNG or JPG.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/convert/resize-image\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Resize Image</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Resize images online for free. Change image width and height while maintaining quality.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/convert/hashtag-generator\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">AI Creator Tools</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">AI Hashtag Generator</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Generate grouped hashtag ideas with free AI generation available and no account required.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/convert/text-case-converter\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Text Tools</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Text Case Converter</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Convert text to uppercase, lowercase, title case, sentence case or slug case.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/convert/watermark-image\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-blue-300\">Image Tools</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Watermark Image</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">Add text watermark to images online for free. Protect JPG, PNG and WEBP images instantly.</p></a></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 pb-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl border-l-4 border-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/5 p-7\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black\">Explore AI Creator Tools</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-300\">Use free Gemini-powered generation for creator drafts, captions, hooks and content ideas. Daily free usage limit applies. No account or API key is required.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/ai-tools\">Browse Free AI Creator Tools</a></div></section><section class=\"px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2\"><aside class=\"rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/5 p-6\"><span class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-amber-300/40 bg-amber-300/10 text-amber-200 \">RECOMMENDED PARTNER</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-black text-white\">Wondershare Filmora</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-300\">After generating your hook, script or title, use Filmora to edit and polish your video content. Results still depend on your creative work and audience fit.</p><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Create, edit and polish videos for YouTube, TikTok, Reels and social content with Filmora.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://www.jdoqocy.com/click-101806287-13985389\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\" class=\"rounded-xl bg-amber-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 hover:bg-amber-200\">Try Filmora</a><a href=\"https://www.tkqlhce.com/click-101806287-17014546\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\" class=\"rounded-xl border border-amber-300/25 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-100 hover:bg-amber-300/10\">Try image-to-video</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\">Affiliate disclosure: this page may contain affiliate links. If you buy through these links, A2ZConvertor may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p></aside></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-slate-900/40 px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Why use these tools?</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><p class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Use focused tools for social media planning, metadata and content creation workflows.</p><p class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Use AI Creator Tools when you want Gemini-generated captions, hooks and posts, then edit every draft for your audience.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black\">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Do I need an API key?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">No. A2ZConvertor uses its backend Gemini connection and does not ask users for provider keys.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Do I need an account?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">No account is required for the free daily allowance.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Are Social Media Tools separate from AI Creator Tools?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Yes. Social Media Tools is a broader category, while /ai-tools focuses on Gemini-powered creator tools.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Where can I find AI creator tools?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">Use the AI Creator Tools page for captions, hooks, bios, posts and other Gemini-powered drafts.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Do social tools guarantee growth?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-400\">No. They help with workflow and ideas, but reach and engagement depend on many outside factors.</p></div></div><h2 class=\"mt-16 text-2xl font-black\">Explore other categories</h2><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/image-tools\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/pdf-tools\">PDF Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/video-tools\">Video Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/audio-tools\">Audio Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-blue-500/60\" href=\"/text-tools\">Text Tools</a><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-500\" href=\"/tools\">Browse all tools</a></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-12 max-w-7xl\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-5\"><div class=\"\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black\">Get new free tools and creator tips.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-400\">Be first to know when we launch new converters, PDF tools and browser-based productivity tools.</p><form class=\"mt-5 flex gap-3 flex-col\"><label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"_R_d5fiuvb_\">Email address</label><input id=\"_R_d5fiuvb_\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example